<li>Conybeare, "Inquiry How Far the Theory of M. Élie de Beaumont Concerning the Parallelism of the Lines of Elevation of the Same Geological Area, Is Agreeable to the Phaenomena as Exhibited in Great Britain," in Philosophical Magazine and Journal of Science, 1 (1832), 118–126; 4 (1834), 404–414.</li>
